</style></div><div class="hero-03-wrap"><div class="hero-03-text"><div style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, -20px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, -20px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, -20px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, -20px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="animation-on-page-load-1"><h1 class="h1 manifest">Voice AI should feel like talking to a person</h1></div><div style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, -20px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, -20px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, -20px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, -20px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="animation-on-page-load-2"><p class="content-04-body-01 content-04-p manifest"><strong class="bold-text-10">Today&#x27;s voice AI fails at real-world conversations.</strong> It’s slow, turn-based like a walkie-talkie, breaks with interruptions, and doesn’t understand emotion.<br/><br/>Developers can&#x27;t build compelling experiences and users disengage. <strong class="bold-text-22">This limits voice AI</strong> to simple receptionist tasks and basic customer support, blocking meaningful services (sales, therapy, coaching) where dialogue and emotional intelligence matter most. <br/><br/>‍<strong class="bold-text-23">Scaling current tech does not work</strong>.<br/><br/><strong class="bold-text-21">We&#x27;re building voice AI that&#x27;s as natural as talking to a person.</strong> Our approach is a duplex speech-to-speech model that learns conversational behaviour directly from data.<br/><br/>That’s how we <strong class="bold-text-24">make voice the most natural way to interact with AI.</strong><br/></p></div></div></div></div></section><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-7 manifest w-container"><div class="cta manifest"><div class="container-6 manifest"><div class="cta-wrap manifest"><div class="cta-text manifest"><div class="animation-on-page-load-2 subtitle about-us"><h1 class="h1 manifest">Team</h1><p class="content-04-body-01 content-04-p team manifest"><strong class="bold-text-2">We&#x27;ve previously built &amp; commercialised frontier AI products at</strong><br/></p></div></div><div class="logos-list about-us manifest"><div class="logos-item _2 manifest"><a href="https://wayve.ai/" target="_blank" class="w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a2e4aff035250ae11d8479/67e8aa0f75b4f4e2ae364b3b_wayve_primary.png" loading="lazy" width="130" alt="" class="logos-image manifest"/></a></div><div class="logos-item _2 manifest"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/" target="_blank" class="alexa w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a2e4aff035250ae11d8479/67e8aa0f536b1d6220278822_alexa_primary.png" loading="lazy" width="72" alt="" class="logos-image manifest"/></a></div><div class="logos-item _2 manifest"><a href="https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/" target="_blank" class="microsoft w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a2e4aff035250ae11d8479/67e8aa0fbf884665908b3a04_microsoft_primary.png" loading="lazy" width="130" alt="" class="logos-image manifeat"/></a></div><div class="logos-item _2 manifest"><a href="https://onfido.com/" target="_blank" class="w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a2e4aff035250ae11d8479/67e8aa0fb85d1d23575eddb9_onfido_primary.png" loading="lazy" width="126" sizes="126px" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a2e4aff035250ae11d8479/67e8aa0fb85d1d23575eddb9_onfido_primary-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a2e4aff035250ae11d8479/67e8aa0fb85d1d23575eddb9_onfido_primary.png 656w" class="logos-image manifest"/></a></div></div></div><div class="cta-wrap manifest backedby"><div class="cta-text manifest"><div class="animation-on-page-load-2 subtitle about-us"><p class="content-04-body-01 content-04-p team manifest"><strong class="bold-text">We&#x27;re backed by</strong><br/></p><div class="div-block-3"><p class="paragraph-3">Rob Bishop (ex-VP Product, Twitter)</p><p class="paragraph-6 investor">7percent Ventures</p><p class="paragraph-4">Amar Shah (Co-founder, Wayve.ai)</p><p class="paragraph-8">Lattice</p><p id="w-node-_10130dad-8a87-1242-b987-4cf62aed6d07-82fdf06b" class="paragraph-5">BMW iVentures</p><p id="w-node-_7e174c4b-ea09-f7b2-b76c-b331145e919e-82fdf06b" class="paragraph-5">Entrepreneurs First</p><p class="paragraph-7">Carya</p><p id="w-node-_8e07c411-7755-355a-10d1-a824c7c81ed0-82fdf06b" class="paragraph-9">Connect Ventures</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><section class="footer"><div class="footer-main-wrap-2"><div class="footer-container"><div class="footer-wrap"><div data-w-id="2f10a224-f15a-da72-af35-985cf1db8394" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 10%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 10%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 10%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 10%, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="footer-left"><a href="#" class="footer-brand w-inline-block"><img width="80" sizes="(max-width: 1279px) 80px, (max-width: 1439px) 6vw, 80px" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a2e4aff035250ae11d8479/67d3b65fe93cdc55217f09cf_metavoice_white.png" loading="lazy" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a2e4aff035250ae11d8479/67d3b65fe93cdc55217f09cf_metavoice_white-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67a2e4aff035250ae11d8479/67d3b65fe93cdc55217f09cf_metavoic